WEBVTT

00:00:03.330 --> 00:00:04.250
Ruri!

00:00:04.250 --> 00:00:05.830
You okay, Al-kun?!

00:00:06.040 --> 00:00:09.130
What in the world are these?
What about the woman from just now?

00:00:09.130 --> 00:00:12.830
This is her true form.
She'd disguised herself as a person.

00:00:12.830 --> 00:00:15.540
There are lots of the same kind
of magical beasts in this forest,

00:00:15.540 --> 00:00:17.750
and they keep coming after you defeat them!

00:00:17.750 --> 00:00:20.710
Ruri, have you been fighting
by yourself this whole time?

00:00:20.710 --> 00:00:21.750
Well...

00:00:22.170 --> 00:00:25.250
That's because it's my duty.

00:00:25.710 --> 00:00:27.710
How commendable. How admirable.

00:00:28.500 --> 00:00:29.920
You're the one from earlier.

00:00:29.920 --> 00:00:32.250
The merchant who told me about the rumors.

00:00:32.420 --> 00:00:34.420
As expected of the descendant of the hero...

00:00:34.420 --> 00:00:35.920
How courageous.

00:00:35.920 --> 00:00:40.250
Or so I would like to say,
but did you not think that it was odd?

00:00:40.420 --> 00:00:41.710
What do you mean?

00:00:41.710 --> 00:00:44.710
Even though not a single person
in the village has seen a demon,

00:00:44.710 --> 00:00:49.080
a person appeared conveniently in front of you
who had been attacked by one...

00:00:49.460 --> 00:00:50.420
No way...

00:00:50.790 --> 00:00:53.170
Have you finally realized it?

00:00:53.920 --> 00:00:58.540
A foolish human like you cannot save anyone!

00:00:59.630 --> 00:01:01.580
You fail as a hero!

00:01:05.880 --> 00:01:07.170
You bastard...

00:01:07.710 --> 00:01:09.750
Oh, excuse me...

00:01:09.750 --> 00:01:11.960
I hadn't introduced myself yet.

00:01:12.750 --> 00:01:15.250
I am Loki Daeva.

00:01:16.420 --> 00:01:19.250
Pleased to make your acquaintance...

00:01:21.670 --> 00:01:23.960
I'm the only one you have business with, right?

00:01:23.960 --> 00:01:26.250
Why'd you even get Al-kun involved too?!

00:01:26.420 --> 00:01:30.380
No, you see, if anything,
he is the one who is important.

00:01:32.750 --> 00:01:34.580
Are you feigning ignorance?

00:01:34.580 --> 00:01:37.460
Even though you defeated former
Demon King's Army First Commander Romeo,

00:01:37.460 --> 00:01:41.040
and then the Malevolent Dragon
Ouroboros by yourself.

00:01:41.750 --> 00:01:44.710
So, you are one of their comrades after all!

00:01:44.710 --> 00:01:46.080
Comrade?

00:01:47.330 --> 00:01:52.040
I don't want to be lumped together
with those kinds of crude beings.

00:01:52.790 --> 00:01:55.670
Well then, from which one shall I...

00:03:31.380 --> 00:03:32.250
Weak!

00:03:32.250 --> 00:03:33.330
Too weak...

00:03:35.080 --> 00:03:36.250
Ruri!

00:03:39.000 --> 00:03:40.210
Oh...

00:03:40.210 --> 00:03:43.380
You're able to use recovery magic?

00:03:41.080 --> 00:03:44.080
<b>The Farmer and the Hero Who Can't Become a Hero</b>

00:03:43.380 --> 00:03:46.790
Oh dear, it appears I had gotten the order wrong.

00:03:46.790 --> 00:03:49.000
I should have started with you.

00:03:49.790 --> 00:03:53.250
Al-kun, I'm sorry... Because of me...

00:03:53.250 --> 00:03:55.210
There's no need to apologize.

00:03:55.210 --> 00:03:57.290
Right now, we've gotta do something
about this guy.

00:03:57.290 --> 00:04:00.540
But I couldn't counter him at all.

00:04:00.540 --> 00:04:02.250
Be careful, Al-kun.

00:04:02.250 --> 00:04:04.040
Yeah, I'll be fine.

00:04:04.040 --> 00:04:06.750
Because I'm a foremost first-rate farmer!

00:04:13.000 --> 00:04:15.130
Huh... Well, well.

00:04:16.130 --> 00:04:18.380
However, I will have you go away.

00:04:23.880 --> 00:04:25.040
Al-kun!

00:04:26.920 --> 00:04:28.250
No way!

00:04:41.710 --> 00:04:43.000
One more hit!

00:04:44.710 --> 00:04:47.330
Please don't get carried away!

00:04:47.330 --> 00:04:48.330
Die!

00:04:59.880 --> 00:05:01.960
Hmm, I see...

00:05:02.460 --> 00:05:04.880
This amount of power with bare hands?

00:05:07.210 --> 00:05:12.330
Since they were just pawns,
it's no wonder they were no match for you...  

00:05:12.500 --> 00:05:13.670
His wounds!

00:05:14.130 --> 00:05:17.040
However, I am different, you know?

00:05:18.210 --> 00:05:19.380
Heal!

00:05:19.880 --> 00:05:22.330
You really are troublesome.

00:05:22.790 --> 00:05:26.210
That being said, you were able
to get a single hit through to me.

00:05:26.210 --> 00:05:28.380
You're allowed to take pride in that, you know?

00:05:28.380 --> 00:05:31.630
Now then, it seems like things
are about to end, I think?

00:05:31.920 --> 00:05:33.580
How disappointing.

00:05:33.580 --> 00:05:36.420
And I had thought you would be
able to entertain me more...

00:05:37.290 --> 00:05:38.290
Hey.

00:05:38.290 --> 00:05:41.130
Didn't you say earlier that I was important too?

00:05:42.420 --> 00:05:43.380
Yes.

00:05:44.290 --> 00:05:45.880
What do you mean by that?

00:05:46.790 --> 00:05:51.380
Although I know you are
obviously stalling for time, very well.

00:05:51.380 --> 00:05:53.080
I shall tell you.

00:05:54.170 --> 00:05:59.170
I am eliminating elements
that might interfere with the plan.

00:05:59.170 --> 00:06:02.670
The ones I have my eyes on are the two of you,

00:06:02.670 --> 00:06:06.750
and also that woman who gained
the power of the Malevolent Dragon.

00:06:06.750 --> 00:06:08.420
Helen-san?

00:06:09.540 --> 00:06:11.580
You're targeting her too?

00:06:15.130 --> 00:06:17.880
Well, well. So, you're acquainted with her?

00:06:18.790 --> 00:06:21.290
While I am at it, I shall tell you this.

00:06:21.290 --> 00:06:25.130
As you are the hero,
you have the Power of the Good God.

00:06:25.460 --> 00:06:30.420
And you see, the Demon King has
been given the Power of the Evil God.

00:06:30.420 --> 00:06:33.040
But the Evil God was supposed
to have been weakened

00:06:33.040 --> 00:06:34.960
when the Demon King was defeated...

00:06:36.670 --> 00:06:38.960
Is that not the same for you too?

00:06:38.960 --> 00:06:41.420
Because it appears you have
not been able to release

00:06:41.420 --> 00:06:43.380
even a trace of the Power of the Good God.

00:06:44.750 --> 00:06:47.830
Now then, so much for the chitchat.

00:06:47.830 --> 00:06:50.330
Shall we end this now?

00:07:05.580 --> 00:07:08.580
Huh... Do you still intend to keep going?

00:07:11.540 --> 00:07:12.540
Al-kun!

00:07:12.790 --> 00:07:15.460
Run! I'll hold them back here!

00:07:15.460 --> 00:07:17.500
You escape alone!

00:07:17.500 --> 00:07:18.500
I refuse!

00:07:18.670 --> 00:07:19.710
Al-kun?!

00:07:28.330 --> 00:07:29.290
Al-kun...

00:07:30.580 --> 00:07:31.580
I...

00:07:32.630 --> 00:07:35.000
am going to become the ultimate farmer!

00:07:35.000 --> 00:07:37.170
If I abandon you here...

00:07:37.750 --> 00:07:39.750
I'll become the worst ever, you know?!

00:07:48.880 --> 00:07:50.210
Oh dear.

00:07:50.210 --> 00:07:52.290
You're rather persistent.

00:08:12.960 --> 00:08:14.290
Ruri...

00:08:14.290 --> 00:08:15.500
You okay?

00:08:15.880 --> 00:08:18.290
Yeah... And you, Al-kun?

00:08:18.290 --> 00:08:21.540
I'm totally... Okay...

00:08:25.670 --> 00:08:27.420
My apologies.

00:08:27.420 --> 00:08:29.790
I did go a little overboard.

00:08:29.920 --> 00:08:33.460
It seems I'm not very good at things
like going easy.

00:08:45.420 --> 00:08:50.210
To tell you the truth, I didn't intend
to kill you right from the start.

00:08:50.210 --> 00:08:53.000
My objective was to fight you. so...

00:08:54.330 --> 00:08:57.670
I think I have fulfilled my duty, you know?

00:08:57.670 --> 00:09:00.000
It was rather enjoyable.

00:09:01.250 --> 00:09:04.880
Once these things stick to you,
they never let go.

00:09:04.880 --> 00:09:08.540
If you ineptly try to remove them,
your skin will be torn out.

00:09:08.540 --> 00:09:10.000
Dammit...

00:09:10.710 --> 00:09:15.460
Now then, I am sorry, but you're unneeded.

00:09:15.460 --> 00:09:17.750
So, I shall have you die here.

00:09:25.040 --> 00:09:29.000
Ah... Someone like me couldn't do it after all...

00:09:29.500 --> 00:09:31.290
I'm sorry, Al-kun...

00:09:31.670 --> 00:09:33.920
Dad, Mom...

00:09:34.380 --> 00:09:37.880
Ruri, don't mind the comments around you!

00:09:38.630 --> 00:09:43.250
But everyone says that I can't become a hero...

00:09:43.420 --> 00:09:45.000
That's not true.

00:09:45.000 --> 00:09:48.380
I'm your father and I'll be on your side
no matter what, okay?

00:09:48.380 --> 00:09:49.880
He's right, Ruri.

00:09:49.880 --> 00:09:54.250
No matter what anyone says,
you should walk your own path.

00:09:54.750 --> 00:09:57.750
If I do that, then will I become a hero?

00:09:57.750 --> 00:09:58.670
Yes.

00:09:58.670 --> 00:10:02.250
That's right. You do what you want, Ruri.

00:10:03.080 --> 00:10:04.040
Okay!

00:10:04.040 --> 00:10:07.790
I'm definitely gonna become
a strong and great hero!

00:10:09.630 --> 00:10:13.130
I'm sorry for letting you down...

00:10:13.710 --> 00:10:16.830
Goodbye, descendant of the hero...

00:10:17.330 --> 00:10:18.630
I...

00:10:19.420 --> 00:10:21.670
wasn't able to become a hero!

00:10:26.830 --> 00:10:29.880
Goodbye, descendant of the hero...

00:10:50.170 --> 00:10:51.330
This is...

00:10:51.670 --> 00:10:53.420
It's nigari.

00:10:53.420 --> 00:10:54.580
Nigari?

00:10:55.000 --> 00:10:55.960
Yeah.

00:10:55.960 --> 00:10:59.000
It's the stuff I was going to try using
as tomata fertilizer.

00:10:59.670 --> 00:11:02.960
It has a coagulant effect,
so it's also used as a pesticide.

00:11:03.170 --> 00:11:05.130
For example, like on leeches!

00:11:06.080 --> 00:11:08.880
With this, these monsters
can't regenerate anymore, you know?

00:11:10.330 --> 00:11:13.040
I see. As expected of a farmer.

00:11:13.290 --> 00:11:16.330
However, with those wounds,
far from being able to attack,

00:11:16.330 --> 00:11:18.630
it should be all you can do to just stand now...

00:11:18.630 --> 00:11:19.960
Shut up!

00:11:23.500 --> 00:11:25.000
Instead of getting in my way,

00:11:25.000 --> 00:11:27.580
it would be smart of you to
be quiet and behave yourself, you know?

00:11:28.170 --> 00:11:29.170
Shut up!

00:11:29.170 --> 00:11:30.330
I...

00:11:30.540 --> 00:11:33.330
Al-kun, why would you go that far?

00:11:33.710 --> 00:11:36.330
I'll defeat you and save Ruri!

00:11:36.710 --> 00:11:39.080
And I won't even let you
get your hands on Helen-san!

00:11:39.250 --> 00:11:40.670
Never!

00:11:42.170 --> 00:11:43.460
That's right...

00:11:43.960 --> 00:11:46.080
I was always thinking that...

00:11:46.250 --> 00:11:48.380
Why are you that weak?

00:11:48.380 --> 00:11:51.040
If you're like that, you won't become a hero.

00:11:51.040 --> 00:11:53.380
That's because you don't have power.

00:11:54.210 --> 00:11:58.500
...I can't become a hero,
or so I let myself be convinced of that,

00:11:58.500 --> 00:12:00.250
and I'd given up...

00:12:01.670 --> 00:12:03.750
But Al-kun...

00:12:03.960 --> 00:12:06.750
He hasn't given up on defeating that bastard!

00:12:07.710 --> 00:12:11.540
Even though he's that battered,
in order to save me...

00:12:11.540 --> 00:12:12.790
Take this!

00:12:15.130 --> 00:12:18.540
It doesn't matter if one has power or not!

00:12:18.710 --> 00:12:23.710
To save people, to protect them,
to never give up.

00:12:23.710 --> 00:12:25.170
Isn't that what a hero is?!

00:12:29.000 --> 00:12:30.380
That's enough, isn't it?

00:12:30.380 --> 00:12:32.500
If you don't stay still, then you'll really die-

00:12:33.460 --> 00:12:35.420
You're the one who's gonna die!

00:12:36.210 --> 00:12:37.250
Oh?

00:12:37.670 --> 00:12:39.920
I'm sorry, I was wrong...

00:12:41.170 --> 00:12:44.290
I can't believe I didn't realize
such a simple thing, you know?

00:12:44.500 --> 00:12:45.460
Ruri...

00:12:45.460 --> 00:12:46.960
I'm okay now.

00:12:47.540 --> 00:12:49.330
Thanks, Al-kun!

00:12:49.920 --> 00:12:51.750
It's useless.

00:12:51.750 --> 00:12:57.830
It's not useless, because I realized it's
wrong to give up just because I can't win!

00:13:03.710 --> 00:13:05.750
I'm also not going to give up!

00:13:06.330 --> 00:13:07.710
Never!

00:13:13.500 --> 00:13:14.580
Impossible!

00:13:18.080 --> 00:13:20.580
Prepare to die, Loki Daeva!

00:13:21.250 --> 00:13:22.460
This is...

00:13:22.830 --> 00:13:24.630
the Power of the Good God!

00:13:24.630 --> 00:13:26.130
Saint Condemnation...

00:13:26.130 --> 00:13:28.500
Sagred Eater!

00:13:32.420 --> 00:13:35.750
This can't be happening! Not to me!

00:13:35.750 --> 00:13:36.880
You're finished!

00:13:47.330 --> 00:13:50.290
Without fail, we will...

00:13:57.630 --> 00:13:58.880
I did it...

00:13:59.130 --> 00:14:00.290
Al-kun!

00:14:00.290 --> 00:14:02.460
Ruri, you're amazing...

00:14:02.460 --> 00:14:03.880
Yeah, thanks!

00:14:04.130 --> 00:14:06.000
Thanks to you, I...

00:14:06.000 --> 00:14:07.420
Ruri, you're...

00:14:07.420 --> 00:14:08.880
a hero after all...

00:14:08.880 --> 00:14:10.130
Oh! Al-kun?!

00:14:10.130 --> 00:14:11.790
Al-kun, hang in there!

00:14:17.630 --> 00:14:20.040
Thanks for your hard work, Al-kun.

00:14:20.040 --> 00:14:21.710
Get plenty of rest.

00:14:23.710 --> 00:14:27.460
It seems I have a crush on you.

00:14:28.880 --> 00:14:31.420
I really like you, Al...

00:14:40.540 --> 00:14:41.880
You awake?

00:14:48.670 --> 00:14:49.670
Ow!

00:14:52.670 --> 00:14:54.000
Sorry, sorry!

00:14:54.000 --> 00:14:58.250
Oh, no, how do I say this?
Um, thanks for that.

00:14:58.250 --> 00:14:59.250
For what?

00:14:59.250 --> 00:14:59.960
Huh?

00:15:01.540 --> 00:15:02.710
Uh, it's nothing!

00:15:05.670 --> 00:15:07.750
It got dark fast.

00:15:08.250 --> 00:15:13.130
Actually, since you fell asleep,
I'd thought I'd carry you on my back and head out,

00:15:13.130 --> 00:15:15.170
but I didn't know the way back.

00:15:15.750 --> 00:15:16.830
Sorry about that.

00:15:17.210 --> 00:15:18.880
Nothing you can do about that.

00:15:19.170 --> 00:15:22.250
Now then, I've recovered a bit since I rested,

00:15:22.250 --> 00:15:23.330
so should we head back?

00:15:23.330 --> 00:15:24.290
Okay!

00:15:31.210 --> 00:15:33.790
Hey, did you hear something just now?

00:15:34.630 --> 00:15:35.880
Hear what?

00:15:36.210 --> 00:15:38.130
Could it be Loki is still...

00:15:39.540 --> 00:15:40.960
Where?

00:15:41.580 --> 00:15:42.460
No, he should've been defeated for sure.

00:15:42.460 --> 00:15:44.290
Where are you?
No, he should've been defeated for sure.<b></b>

00:15:44.290 --> 00:15:45.170
Where are you?
Right?<b></b>

00:15:45.540 --> 00:15:47.380
Then, what's that?

00:15:47.380 --> 00:15:49.130
Al...

00:15:49.830 --> 00:15:51.130
Where...

00:15:51.330 --> 00:15:53.130
are you?

00:15:53.630 --> 00:15:55.920
See! Didn't you hear that just now?

00:15:55.920 --> 00:15:57.290
Y-yeah?

00:15:58.920 --> 00:16:00.500
You can't handle stuff like this?

00:16:00.500 --> 00:16:01.630
I can't!

00:16:02.130 --> 00:16:04.420
I can defeat undead-types with a sword,

00:16:04.420 --> 00:16:06.710
but I don't do well with ghost-types
that aren't corporeal!

00:16:06.710 --> 00:16:08.420
You never know
what they could do to you!

00:16:08.420 --> 00:16:10.710
Wouldn't you hate it if you got
possessed or something?!

00:16:12.040 --> 00:16:13.130
That's for sure...

00:16:15.130 --> 00:16:17.380
Al...

00:16:18.040 --> 00:16:22.170
Where are you?

00:16:22.830 --> 00:16:25.130
It's getting closer and closer!

00:16:25.130 --> 00:16:26.000
Yeah...

00:16:26.880 --> 00:16:28.040
Al?

00:16:28.290 --> 00:16:30.790
Al?! Are you there?!

00:16:31.210 --> 00:16:32.380
That voice just now...

00:16:32.380 --> 00:16:33.630
It's Mom!

00:16:35.210 --> 00:16:37.830
Crap! Ruri's gonna get killed!

00:16:38.460 --> 00:16:40.170
Ruri, we're gonna run!

00:16:40.170 --> 00:16:41.330
O-okay!

00:16:41.580 --> 00:16:42.290
Huh?!

00:16:44.580 --> 00:16:48.040
Gonna die! Gonna die! Gonna die!
Don't wanna die! Dammit!

00:16:51.750 --> 00:16:53.290
We outran it...

00:16:55.250 --> 00:16:57.290
What?! Did you just laugh?

00:16:57.540 --> 00:17:01.080
Well, Al-kun, you did run away like crazy.

00:17:01.080 --> 00:17:03.710
Well, I was so scared
I felt more dead than alive...

00:17:04.040 --> 00:17:06.830
So, you were scared of ghosts after all?

00:17:06.830 --> 00:17:07.540
Al!

00:17:07.540 --> 00:17:09.210
No, well...

00:17:09.710 --> 00:17:12.670
It's something even scarier than that, though...

00:17:18.210 --> 00:17:21.250
The hotel... Isn't there...

00:17:21.250 --> 00:17:24.880
Maybe that was an illusion
that Loki created too...

00:17:24.880 --> 00:17:25.960
Right...

00:17:27.330 --> 00:17:29.170
I'll get lodging over there for today.

00:17:29.710 --> 00:17:30.580
Oh...

00:17:30.580 --> 00:17:32.330
Oh yeah.

00:17:32.330 --> 00:17:36.170
I plan on obtaining the nigari one more time
tomorrow morning before departing,

00:17:36.170 --> 00:17:38.210
so can I count on you for the armed escort
we agreed on, Ruri?

00:17:38.210 --> 00:17:39.290
Of course.

00:17:41.790 --> 00:17:44.500
I hope Mom hasn't gotten home already...

00:17:45.080 --> 00:17:46.880
Because it did happen in the past too...

00:17:47.380 --> 00:17:50.790
There was that time Testa and I
secretly went far away to go play.

00:17:51.130 --> 00:17:51.380
Al!

00:17:51.380 --> 00:17:53.420
Al!
Mom got worried and came searching for us,<b></b>

00:17:53.420 --> 00:17:55.250
and since we thought we were going to get yelled at,

00:17:55.250 --> 00:17:58.250
we hurried and went back home
so that we wouldn't be found, but then...

00:18:00.630 --> 00:18:05.130
Somehow Mom was already in the house
standing by and waiting...

00:18:07.080 --> 00:18:10.290
Is she able to teleport or something?

00:18:12.000 --> 00:18:13.040
I'm home...

00:18:13.040 --> 00:18:14.290
Al!

00:18:14.290 --> 00:18:15.420
I knew it!

00:18:24.500 --> 00:18:26.540
I was worried about you, Al!

00:18:27.040 --> 00:18:27.920
How?!

00:18:27.920 --> 00:18:29.420
Oh, Al. You're home.

00:18:29.960 --> 00:18:31.460
Mom was worried about...

00:18:31.830 --> 00:18:33.040
W-wait!

00:18:33.040 --> 00:18:35.000
I'm the one who's going to get yelled at,
you know?!

00:18:35.000 --> 00:18:36.250
Hey, Al?!

00:18:36.250 --> 00:18:37.250
Al!

00:18:44.290 --> 00:18:46.290
Al, don't go!

00:18:46.290 --> 00:18:48.170
Let go, Mom!

00:18:48.170 --> 00:18:50.000
C'mon, Lucica...

00:18:50.830 --> 00:18:51.830
Dad!

00:18:54.330 --> 00:18:56.130
You should lay off about now.

00:18:56.130 --> 00:18:58.420
You're putting Al on the spot too, you know?

00:18:58.420 --> 00:19:00.170
You stay quiet.

00:19:00.170 --> 00:19:01.210
Yes ma'am...

00:19:01.210 --> 00:19:02.290
Dad!

00:19:02.290 --> 00:19:05.420
Hey, Al. Won't you stay here, after all?

00:19:05.580 --> 00:19:09.210
I have no choice. This pains me a little, but...

00:19:09.210 --> 00:19:13.380
If you make me do this,
I might end up hating you.

00:19:13.380 --> 00:19:15.580
Oh! I-I'm sorry!

00:19:16.790 --> 00:19:19.460
Well, I've got to go now.  

00:19:19.460 --> 00:19:22.250
All right. But tell me something.

00:19:22.250 --> 00:19:22.960
Huh?

00:19:22.960 --> 00:19:26.210
Do you still intend to continue being a farmer?

00:19:27.500 --> 00:19:28.460
Yeah.

00:19:28.460 --> 00:19:29.750
I see...

00:19:29.750 --> 00:19:33.040
You know, I don't think you need
to have it weigh on your mind.

00:19:33.040 --> 00:19:33.710
What?

00:19:33.920 --> 00:19:35.540
If that matter is the reason

00:19:35.540 --> 00:19:39.000
you are bound to a sense of obligation
or like a sense of vocation, then...

00:19:44.750 --> 00:19:47.330
No, don't worry, Mom.

00:19:47.330 --> 00:19:51.250
You see, I chose the path of a farmer
because I like farming.

00:19:51.830 --> 00:19:54.920
This is the thing that I want to do.

00:19:58.130 --> 00:20:00.750
You are a really kind child.

00:20:00.750 --> 00:20:03.790
But don't get crushed by that kindness.

00:20:04.580 --> 00:20:07.290
It's okay to be self-indulgent
once in a while, you know?

00:20:07.290 --> 00:20:08.250
Okay...

00:20:08.250 --> 00:20:10.710
Live a way of life with no regrets, okay?

00:20:10.710 --> 00:20:11.750
I know.

00:20:11.750 --> 00:20:14.250
Well then, do your best from here on too.

00:20:14.540 --> 00:20:15.830
For lots of things...

00:20:16.210 --> 00:20:19.250
Yeah. Thanks, Mom.

00:20:20.040 --> 00:20:22.210
Take care, Al.

00:20:29.080 --> 00:20:31.630
Oh, you finally came! You're late!

00:20:31.630 --> 00:20:32.540
My bad!

00:20:32.750 --> 00:20:35.170
And the nigari?
Were you able to procure it?

00:20:36.330 --> 00:20:38.380
Yeah, as you can see!

00:20:39.290 --> 00:20:41.420
All right, shall we depart?

00:20:41.420 --> 00:20:42.330
Okay!

00:20:42.330 --> 00:20:44.380
You're energetic as usual.

00:20:45.920 --> 00:20:49.880
By the way, Al-kun, it seemed like
you were being targeted by Loki too.

00:20:51.750 --> 00:20:55.830
No, you see, if anything,
he is the one who is important.

00:20:55.830 --> 00:20:58.790
My objective was to fight you, so...

00:21:01.210 --> 00:21:03.580
Do you have any ideas why?

00:21:03.750 --> 00:21:05.460
No, not particularly.

00:21:05.460 --> 00:21:09.830
Al-kun, it seems like you'll probably be targeted
by demons from here on too, you know?

00:21:09.830 --> 00:21:13.500
But the same goes for you too, right?
Since you're a hero.

00:21:14.580 --> 00:21:17.210
If something should happen,
then please tell me.

00:21:17.210 --> 00:21:18.790
I'll go to your rescue.

00:21:22.080 --> 00:21:23.000
What's the matter?

00:21:23.250 --> 00:21:24.920
I-it's nothing!

00:21:29.290 --> 00:21:32.080
Aw... He took the words...

00:21:32.500 --> 00:21:34.210
right out of my mouth...

00:21:45.250 --> 00:21:46.290
Fal-sama.

00:21:47.960 --> 00:21:49.880
The king is calling for you.

00:21:50.540 --> 00:21:52.880
Yes. I'm coming.

00:23:29.330 --> 00:23:40.330
<b>Episode 7</b>

00:23:29.330 --> 00:23:40.330
<b>The Farmer and the Princess's Resolve</b>
